{
  "title": "Hero Constant — 15s calm product story",
  "_style": "Decoded from Starbucks-style spots: the hero product never moves (one fixed position for the whole film) while the WORLD around it changes: colour, shapes, context. Soft drifting circles, calm ease-in-out, a pop per icon, a chime on the logo. Calm confidence: fewer, slower moves.",
